    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Across The Globe</h2>A grand Strategy Game Set In 19th-century World.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play The World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed world map, with five different projections to choose from.<br></li><li>World wide trade network, witness globalization at its onset.<br></li><li>Multi-thread optimized game engine, fast load and fast turns.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic population</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>People reproduce, age, die, migrate and change jobs.<br></li><li>Government, economy, military are all fueled by your people.<br></li><li>Different ideas steer the course of society.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic Economy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Prices respond to demand and supply.<br></li><li>Producers expand and shrink.<br></li><li>Elastic demand depending on income and prices.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Great Power Diplomacy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Land and naval combat to conquer foes.<br></li><li>Influence lesser nations to enforce free trade.<br></li><li>Intervene in wars to contain your rivals.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Across The Globe</h2>A grand Strategy Game Set In 19th-century World.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play The World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed world map, with five different projections to choose from.<br></li><li>World wide trade network, witness globalization at its onset.<br></li><li>Multi-thread optimized game engine, fast load and fast turns.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic population</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>People reproduce, age, die, migrate and change jobs.<br></li><li>Government, economy, military are all fueled by your people.<br></li><li>Different ideas steer the course of society.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic Economy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Prices respond to demand and supply.<br></li><li>Producers expand and shrink.<br></li><li>Elastic demand depending on income and prices.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Great Power Diplomacy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Land and naval combat to conquer foes.<br></li><li>Influence lesser nations to enforce free trade.<br></li><li>Intervene in wars to contain your rivals.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A nation simulator set in 19th-century. Acquire resources, research technologies, build infrastructure, conquer foes. Experience dynamic population, realistic economy and great power diplomacy.",
